{
  "date": "2026-11-25",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "工行上海分行和蚂蚁国际签约，一起做跨境支付和数字人民币",
  "title_en": "ICBC's Shanghai branch signs an agreement with Ant International to work together on cross-border payments and the digital yuan",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "据移动支付网11月24日报道，中国工商银行上海市分行和蚂蚁国际签了一份战略合作备忘录，两家要在跨境金融方面加强合作。",
      "en": "According to a Mpaypass report on November 24, the Shanghai branch of the Industrial and Commercial Bank of China (ICBC) and Ant International have signed a strategic cooperation memorandum, and the two will strengthen their cooperation in cross-border finance."
    },
    {
      "zh": "按照备忘录，在符合法律和监管要求的前提下，两家会在几个方面合作：跨境人民币、数字人民币、跨境支付二维码的互联互通、金融市场交易、用区块链管理跨境资金，还有建设新兴市场的生态。",
      "en": "Under the memorandum, on the condition that they meet legal and regulatory requirements, the two will cooperate in several areas: cross-border RMB, the digital yuan, interconnecting cross-border payment QR codes, financial market trading, using blockchain to manage cross-border funds, and building ecosystems in emerging markets."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在这次合作中，工行会用上它在全球的金融服务，蚂蚁国际会提供数字技术和用在各种场景里的技术。",
      "en": "In this partnership, ICBC will bring in its financial services around the world, and Ant International will provide digital technology and technology used in many kinds of scenarios."
    },
    {
      "zh": "两家下一步的计划包括跨境电商、让人们出入境旅行更方便，以及在更多场景中使用跨境人民币。蚂蚁国际是蚂蚁集团的国际业务公司，Alipay+就是它的一个产品。",
      "en": "The two sides' next plans include cross-border e-commerce, making it easier for people to travel in and out of the country, and using cross-border RMB in more scenarios. Ant International is Ant Group's international business company, and Alipay+ is one of its products."
    }
  ],
